Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:32.14,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55}Now, I release it outside its cage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:37.90,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55\q2}Rusted keys, beats that have stopped resounding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:42.67,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55}I was realizing "I can't return anymore"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:47.94,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55\fs40}The lost days (Hey baby why?)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:53.49,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55\fs32\q2}are going to be connected immaturely (I want to cry...)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:58.62,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55}I don't want to lose to my fearful self
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:01:04.42,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55}I won't run away from my fate, "I'm not alone"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:08.26,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55}I'll be by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:15.22,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55}no matter how sad a dream it is, I don't mind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:20.02,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55}I want to be touched by your tears... baby
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:22.85,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55\fs37}I pray... "believe"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:28.90,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.55}Tear the darkness of your cold memories to pieces
